{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2662","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"fraction_original_capacity_net_change","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah tangki pada mulanya 3/5 penuh. Air sebanyak 1/4 daripada kapasiti penuh ditambah, kemudian 1/10 daripada kapasiti penuh digunakan. Apakah pecahan kapasiti tangki yang berisi air sekarang?","options":["3/4","13/20","7/10","4/5"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["3/5 + 1/4 = 12/20 + 5/20 = 17/20.","1/10 = 2/20, jadi 17/20 − 2/20 = 15/20.","15/20 = 3/4."],"visual":{"kind":"fraction_bar","parts":5,"selected":3}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2664","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"percent_present_after_late_arrivals","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Daripada 240 murid, 35% tidak hadir pada awal program. Kemudian 18 murid yang tidak hadir tiba lewat. Berapakah murid yang akhirnya hadir?","options":["156","174","166","184"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Murid tidak hadir pada awalnya = 35% × 240 = 84.","Murid hadir pada awalnya = 240 − 84 = 156.","Selepas 18 murid tiba lewat: 156 + 18 = 174."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2665","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"ratio_total_from_difference_4_7","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Nisbah bilangan peserta Kumpulan A kepada Kumpulan B ialah 4:7. Kumpulan B mempunyai 27 peserta lebih ramai. Berapakah jumlah peserta kedua-dua kumpulan?","options":["81","90","99","108"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Perbezaan bahagian = 7 − 4 = 3 bahagian = 27.","Satu bahagian = 27 ÷ 3 = 9.","Jumlah = (4 + 7) × 9 = 99."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2666","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"median_after_lowest_removed","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 6, 10, 13, 17 dan 21. Jika nilai terendah dibuang, berapakah median data yang tinggal?","options":["13","14","17","15"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Selepas 6 dibuang, data ialah 10, 13, 17 dan 21.","Median bagi 4 nilai ialah purata dua nilai tengah.","(13 + 17) ÷ 2 = 15."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[6,10,13,17,21]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2667","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"joined_rectangles_perimeter","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Dua segi empat tepat 10 cm × 6 cm dicantum sepanjang satu sisi 6 cm tanpa bertindih. Berapakah perimeter bentuk gabungan?","options":["52 cm","44 cm","56 cm","64 cm"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah perimeter dua segi empat tepat = 2 × 2(10 + 6) = 64 cm.","Sisi 6 cm yang bercantum menjadi bahagian dalam dan dikira dua kali.","Perimeter gabungan = 64 − 2(6) = 52 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2668","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"rectangle_area_after_corner_removed","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan kad 18 cm × 12 cm. Sebuah petak 4 cm × 4 cm dipotong dari satu penjuru. Berapakah luas kad yang tinggal?","options":["192 cm²","200 cm²","204 cm²","216 cm²"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Luas kad asal = 18 × 12 = 216 cm².","Luas petak dipotong = 4 × 4 = 16 cm².","Luas tinggal = 216 − 16 = 200 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":18,"width_cm":12}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2669","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"difference_two_cuboids_volume","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah kuboid A berukuran 12 cm × 8 cm × 5 cm. Kuboid B berukuran 10 cm × 6 cm × 4 cm. Berapakah beza isi padu kedua-duanya?","options":["200 cm³","280 cm³","240 cm³","720 cm³"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu A = 12 × 8 × 5 = 480 cm³.","Isi padu B = 10 × 6 × 4 = 240 cm³.","Beza = 480 − 240 = 240 cm³."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2670","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"journey_three_stages_end_time","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Perjalanan bermula pada 7:35 pagi. Bahagian pertama mengambil 45 minit, berhenti 20 minit, kemudian perjalanan kedua 1 jam 10 minit. Pada pukul berapakah tiba?","options":["9:30 pagi","9:40 pagi","10:00 pagi","9:50 pagi"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["7:35 + 45 minit = 8:20 pagi.","Tambah rehat 20 minit = 8:40 pagi.","Tambah 1 jam 10 minit = 9:50 pagi."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2671","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"savings_target_after_purchase","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Aisyah mempunyai RM85 dan mahu menyimpan sekurang-kurangnya RM40. Dia membeli buku RM18.50 dan alat tulis RM12.80. Berapakah wang yang masih boleh dibelanjakan tanpa mengurangkan simpanan RM40?","options":["RM13.70","RM12.70","RM14.70","RM53.70"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah pembelian = RM18.50 + RM12.80 = RM31.30.","Wang selepas pembelian = RM85 − RM31.30 = RM53.70.","Wang boleh dibelanjakan sambil kekal simpan RM40 = RM53.70 − RM40 = RM13.70."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2672","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mode_after_two_values_added","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 4, 7, 7, 9 dan 12. Dua nilai baharu, 7 dan 10, ditambah. Apakah mod data baharu?","options":["9","7","10","Tiada mod"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Nilai 7 pada asalnya muncul dua kali.","Selepas satu lagi 7 ditambah, nilai 7 muncul tiga kali.","Nilai lain muncul sekali, jadi mod = 7."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[4,7,7,9,12]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2673","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"reflex_angle_from_full_turn","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Satu sudut kecil pada satu titik ialah 135°. Berapakah sudut refleks antara dua garis yang sama?","options":["135°","180°","225°","245°"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Satu pusingan penuh di sekeliling titik = 360°.","Sudut refleks = 360° − 135° = 225°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-39-2674","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_scaled_horizontal_distance","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Pada grid, A berada di (3,4) dan B di (11,4). Jika 1 unit mewakili 150 m, berapakah jarak sebenar AB?","options":["0.8 km","1.35 km","1.5 km","1.2 km"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jarak mengufuk = 11 − 3 = 8 unit.","8 × 150 m = 1200 m.","1200 m = 1.2 km."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2731","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"hcf_ribbon_equal_pieces","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Dua gulung reben masing-masing panjang 72 cm dan 96 cm hendak dipotong kepada bahagian sama panjang yang paling panjang tanpa baki. Berapakah panjang setiap bahagian?","options":["24 cm","12 cm","18 cm","36 cm"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Cari faktor sepunya terbesar 72 dan 96.","FSTB(72,96) = 24.","Setiap bahagian paling panjang ialah 24 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2732","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"fraction_of_remainder_then_add","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah bekas mempunyai 72 gula-gula. 1/3 dimakan. Kemudian 1/4 daripada baki diberi kepada rakan, dan 6 gula-gula baharu ditambah. Berapakah gula-gula sekarang?","options":["36","42","40","48"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Selepas 1/3 dimakan, baki = 72 − 24 = 48.","1/4 daripada 48 = 12 diberi, jadi baki = 36.","Tambah 6: 36 + 6 = 42."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2734","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"percent_decrease_from_original","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Bilangan botol dalam stor berkurang daripada 250 kepada 200. Berapakah peratus pengurangan?","options":["15%","25%","20%","50%"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Pengurangan = 250 − 200 = 50.","Peratus pengurangan = 50 ÷ 250 × 100%.","Hasil = 20%."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2735","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"ratio_three_groups_total_2_3_5","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Nisbah peserta pasukan Merah:Biru:Hijau ialah 2:3:5. Jika jumlah peserta 150 orang, berapakah peserta pasukan Biru?","options":["30","50","75","45"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah bahagian = 2 + 3 + 5 = 10.","Satu bahagian = 150 ÷ 10 = 15.","Pasukan Biru = 3 × 15 = 45."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2736","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"unknown_value_from_mean_six","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan lima nilai 12, 16, 18, 21 dan 23. Satu nilai x ditambah supaya min enam nilai menjadi 20. Berapakah x?","options":["30","24","27","32"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah diperlukan untuk 6 nilai = 20 × 6 = 120.","Jumlah lima nilai diberi = 12 + 16 + 18 + 21 + 23 = 90.","x = 120 − 90 = 30."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[12,16,18,21,23]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2737","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"square_fence_after_gate","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah kawasan berbentuk segi empat sama mempunyai sisi 18 m. Pagar dipasang di sekelilingnya kecuali pintu selebar 3 m. Berapakah panjang pagar diperlukan?","options":["66 m","69 m","72 m","75 m"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter = 4 × 18 = 72 m.","Bahagian pintu 3 m tidak dipagar.","Panjang pagar = 72 − 3 = 69 m."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2738","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"composite_area_rectangle_plus_square","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan sebuah segi empat tepat 14 cm × 8 cm dicantum dengan sebuah segi empat sama sisi 6 cm tanpa bertindih. Berapakah jumlah luas kedua-dua bentuk?","options":["132 cm²","142 cm²","148 cm²","160 cm²"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Luas segi empat tepat = 14 × 8 = 112 cm².","Luas segi empat sama = 6 × 6 = 36 cm².","Jumlah = 112 + 36 = 148 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":14,"width_cm":8}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2739","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"stacked_cuboids_total_volume","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Dua bongkah kuboid yang sama, setiap satu berukuran 8 cm × 5 cm × 3 cm, disusun tanpa bertindih. Berapakah jumlah isi padu kedua-duanya?","options":["120 cm³","200 cm³","480 cm³","240 cm³"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu satu kuboid = 8 × 5 × 3 = 120 cm³.","Dua kuboid = 2 × 120 = 240 cm³."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2740","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"elapsed_time_across_midnight","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah perjalanan malam bermula pada 10:45 malam dan tamat pada 1:20 pagi hari berikutnya. Berapakah tempohnya?","options":["2 jam 35 minit","2 jam 15 minit","2 jam 45 minit","3 jam 35 minit"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["10:45 malam hingga 12:00 tengah malam = 1 jam 15 minit.","12:00 hingga 1:20 pagi = 1 jam 20 minit.","Jumlah = 2 jam 35 minit."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2741","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"best_value_after_pack_discount","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Pek A mengandungi 5 buku pada RM12.50. Pek B mengandungi 8 buku pada RM21.60 tetapi diberi diskaun RM2.40. Pek manakah lebih murah bagi setiap buku?","options":["Pek A","Pek B","Sama harga","Tidak dapat ditentukan"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Pek A = RM12.50 ÷ 5 = RM2.50 sebuah.","Harga Pek B selepas diskaun = RM21.60 − RM2.40 = RM19.20.","Pek B = RM19.20 ÷ 8 = RM2.40 sebuah, jadi Pek B lebih murah."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2742","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mean_median_difference_six","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Enam nilai ialah 5, 7, 9, 11, 13 dan 15. Berapakah beza antara min dengan median?","options":["1","2","0","3"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Min = (5 + 7 + 9 + 11 + 13 + 15) ÷ 6 = 10.","Median = (9 + 11) ÷ 2 = 10.","Beza = 10 − 10 = 0."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2743","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"bisected_supplementary_angle","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan satu sudut 112° pada garis lurus. Sudut yang bersebelahan dibahagi kepada dua bahagian sama besar, masing-masing x. Berapakah x?","options":["44°","56°","68°","34°"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Sudut bersebelahan = 180° − 112° = 68°.","Sudut itu dibahagi dua sama besar.","x = 68° ÷ 2 = 34°."],"visual":{"kind":"straight_line_angle","known_angle_deg":112}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-40-2744","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_l_route_distance","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Titik P berada di (2,3). Laluan bergerak ke Q(8,3) kemudian ke R(8,7). Berapakah jumlah jarak pada grid dari P ke R melalui Q?","options":["10 unit","6 unit","8 unit","12 unit"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["P ke Q = 8 − 2 = 6 unit.","Q ke R = 7 − 3 = 4 unit.","Jumlah = 6 + 4 = 10 unit."]}
